## Reference — Interference categories

- **Article misuse** (missing/wrong articles)
- **Word order** (adjectives, objects, verbs in unnatural positions)
- **Prepositions** (wrong preposition for English idiom)
- **Collocations** (wrong word pairing; e.g., "make research" not "do research")
- **Tense/aspect** (present simple where present perfect needed)
- **Subject-verb agreement** (plural/singular mismatches)
- **Connectors & discourse** (overuse of formal conjunctions; weak linking)
- **Formality** (over-formal register or unnecessary intensifiers)
